// A subclass instance read through a field of its parent class keeps its constructor arguments.
// The `C` field select on a `B` ctor is dropped by design, but `B`'s ctor hands `y` to the parent ctor, which is opaque.
:flowBasedOpt mono debugDce
:soir
:noInline
:expect [4]
class B(y) extends C(y)
fun inherited() = if B([4]) is C(c) then c else 0
inherited()
